<title>BRAZIL: Sao Paulo stock exchange suspends Arno.</title>
<headline>Sao Paulo stock exchange suspends Arno.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bovespa stock exchange in Sao Paulo said it suspended trade in local home appliance Arno Monday.</p>
<p>The bolsa asked the firm to clarify a news report over the weekend saying that control of the company was about to be sold to a French group.</p>
<p>Arno preferred stock closed at 165.99 reais on Friday.</p>
